# RCF English
#
# This is a plain static website built by Windows PowerShell. There is no
# Node.js, npm or Python in this project, so none of the usual build folders
# exist here.
#
# IMPORTANT: the finished .html pages, sitemap.xml and robots.txt ARE committed
# on purpose. GitHub Pages publishes them directly, with no build step on the
# server, so they must not be ignored.

# Windows and macOS clutter
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# Editor and IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Office lock files, created when a document is open
~$*

# Anything holding a password or a key. Nothing like this belongs in the
# repository, and this is a safety net rather than an expectation.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
credentials*

# Local scratch work
/_scratch/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
